1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,420
(Leonard:)How could you have a girlfriend?

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,890
(Leonard:)You can't even speak to women.

3
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:06,230
(Raj:)Two words-- deaf chick.

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,230
(Raj:)It doesn't matter

5
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:10,500
(Raj:)if I can't talk,
because she can't hear me.

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,100
(Leonard:)What?

7
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,870
(Raj:)That's what she said.

8
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:18,040
(Leonard:)Great. You have a girlfriend,
Howard's got a girlfriend,

9
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,410
(Leonard:)Sheldon's got
a girl...
No, no, no, no!

10
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:20,520
(Leonard:)...who's a friend.

11
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:22,560
(Leonard:)Thank you.

12
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,740
(Leonard:)What about you, Stuart?

13
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,250
(Leonard:)You have a
girlfriend yet?

14
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,500
(Stuart:)Oh, yeah. Yeah.

15
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,000
(Stuart:)I met her at Comic-Con,
the one place in the world

16
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,150
(Stuart:)where saying
"I own a comic bookstore"

17
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:32,900
(Stuart:)is an actual pickup line.

18
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,840
(Leonard:)Oh. Well, good for you.

19
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,940
(Stuart:)Not really. She's horrible.

20
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,360
(Stuart:)When she wants to have sex,

21
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,760
(Stuart:)she puts on her plus-size
Wonder Woman costume and shouts,

22
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:44,560
"Who wants to take a ride
in my invisible plane?"

23
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:48,420
(Leonard:)Why don't you just
break up with her?

24
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,640
(Stuart:)No, no, I can't.

25
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,590
(Leonard:)Why not?

26
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,020
'Cause then I'd be alone,

27
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,390
(Stuart:)like you.

28
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:58,110
(Raj:)Dude, why don't you just invoke
your girlfriend pact

29
00:00:58,110 --> 00:00:59,710
(Raj:)with Wolowitz?

